QUERY NAME: Query9_2
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MonthlyTime.WorkGroup, MonthlyTime.PACTStaffID, MonthlyTime.TimeCode, MonthlyTime.Month, MonthlyTime.ParentProject, MonthlyTime.WorkGroup, MonthlyTime.Hours
FROM MonthlyTime INNER JOIN _SVChanges ON MonthlyTime.PACTStaffID = [_SVChanges].PACTid
WHERE (((MonthlyTime.WorkGroup)<>[WG]));

